y about what people have done...and having the time to look a lot over and read experiences is giving me the time to organize me thoughts and ideas from everyone. I have a list of templates that I want to download when I get to 150 and I look forward to getting there...Happy posting ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1636785,"PostDate":1341102862,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is good info for newbies like me. I like posting so I don't think it will take too long....there are so many nice things to say about what people have done...and having the time to look a lot over and read experiences is giving me the time to organize me thoughts and ideas from everyone. I have a list of templates that I want to download when I get to 150 and I look forward to getting there...Happy posting ladies!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"2bmrstremblay@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1340956059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257267.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"2bmrstremblay","Id":257267,"Name":"2bmrstremblay","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":81,"TotalPages":9,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":80},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
