{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8ec170f925c5721ef6e51b34476e2f7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]stefn1218[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Probably a stupid question, but what is \"bumping\"? \n \n Also, I just started posting and some of my comments have been held for moderation...about how long till they will be posted? \n \n Thanks! I LOVE this website and am super addicted :)[\/quote] \n \n Same question, what does \"bumping\" mean?","Attachments":[],"Id":1640083,"PostDate":1341950516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>stefn1218<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Probably a stupid question, but what is \"bumping\"?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, I just started posting and some of my comments have been held for moderation...about how long till they will be posted?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks! I LOVE this website and am super addicted <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Same question, what does \"bumping\" mean?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sgp147k1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"2.234.176.173","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1325113055,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249008.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":191,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CriCri","Id":249008,"Name":"CriCri","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7a9c90a96fda3de7322cf4d283551dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Bumping means that you comment on the thread to make it \"bump\" to the top of the \"New Posts\" feed.&amp;nbsp; So more people can see it and get the helpful information inside.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1640368,"PostDate":1342020327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Bumping means that you comment on the thread to make it \"bump\" to the top of the \"New Posts\" feed.\u00a0 So more people can see it and get the helpful information inside.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172013300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78167b8a274fe1a76ba20f17cc544ad2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How do you become a Junior Member?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1673796,"PostDate":1350080269,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How do you become a Junior Member?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gladis.m@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1349387018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261027.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Gladis","Id":261027,"Name":"Gladis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":41818,"EditedBy":"",