berostar boards for pics of weddings there at: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.iberostar-board.com\/boards\/index.php\"&gt;IBEROSTAR HOTELS &amp;amp; RESORTS MESSAGE BOARD | IBEROSTAR REVIEWS &amp;amp; PHOTOS - Index&lt;\/a&gt;. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":339444,"PostDate":1213321474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to Iberostar, too but going to del Mar. Check out the Iberostar boards for pics of weddings there at: <a href='http:\/\/www.iberostar-board.com\/boards\/index.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>IBEROSTAR HOTELS & RESORTS MESSAGE BOARD | IBEROSTAR REVIEWS & PHOTOS - Index<\/a>. Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/cancunphotos.bigfolioblog.com\/\">http:\/\/cancunphotos.bigfolioblog.com\/<\/a><br><span>Photo by Sascha Gluck from Cancun Photos<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akwestfall@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1203187579,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208561.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akbeach","Id":208561,"Name":"akbeach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete