> User karleealyssa (284747)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.158.192.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c739fb680ef128dc5679f94b46370f3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalero\" post=\"1867603\" timestamp=\"1408431360\"]\nI believe that the $1800 for the dance floor is optional.  I&#039;ve read that a lot of brides that chose not to do the floor have had fun beach dance parties on the sand and that fine too.  I probably won&#039;t go with the dancefloor option as I find it very expensive.  \n\nWe are thinking of doing the reception at the chillout but I don&#039;t know if the chillout has it&#039;s own dance floor or if they move the dance party to the beach area after.[\/quote]That&#039;s a good question. We are a small group so I am hoping we can move tables to make a small dance floor.","Attachments":[],"Id":1869037,"PostDate":1409055377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalero, on 19 August 2014 - 02:56 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I believe that the $1800 for the dance floor is optional.  I've read that a lot of brides that chose not to do the floor have had fun beach dance parties on the sand and that fine too.  I probably won't go with the dancefloor option as I find it very expensive.  <br><br>\nWe are thinking of doing the reception at the chillout but I don't know if the chillout has it's own dance floor or if they move the dance party to the beach area after.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's a good question. We are a small group so I am hoping we can move tables to make a small dance floor.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rsfortin@telus.net","IpAddress":"75.158.192.149","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401786265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sara1603","Id":278220,"Name":"Sara1603","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5559d73fd18701af30df51f2042a5d11","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ya, I can&#039;t really envision it right now.&amp;nbsp; but I think I will add this to the questions I have.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a long list.&amp;nbsp; lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869052,"PostDate":1409056891,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ya, I can't really envision it right now.\u00a0 but I think I will add this to the questions I have.\u00a0 It's a long list.\u00a0 lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.72.74.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d64c0f4f9d85fc92790d9628b44958b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am just wondering what you guys are doing for hair and makeup? Are you using the onsite salon?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not so worried about my hair but I would like to have my makeup done for the big day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone heard any reviews?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876126,"PostDate":1413667852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am just wondering what you guys are doing for hair and makeup? Are you using the onsite salon?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not so worried about my hair but I would like to have my makeup done for the big day.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone heard any reviews?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\">April \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>______________________________________________________________<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\">\"He stole my heart, so I'm stealing his last name.\"<\/span>","Email":"hextallwedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.72.129.37","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395671209,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277314.jpg?_r=1395716004","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"April2015","Id":277314,"Name":"April2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.76.80.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c892dce5a7db72d9dabbabf6aefb19f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hair and makeup:&amp;nbsp; My mom is a hairdresser, so doing a combo of having her do it and doing it myself.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve heard its a good idea to bring lots of pics or to get your own stylist at home to do a trial and take tons of pics and bring with you.&amp;nbsp; Pictures are better than words.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t speak for this specific salon though, sorry.&amp;nbsp; I feel like hair can be slightly changed or salvaged if its not exactly perfect.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Makeup:&amp;nbsp; My photographer recommends airbrush makeup for the humidity, so I&#039;m going to try to get that.&amp;nbsp; I may just buy my own nice Dior airbrush foundation and do it myself as well.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m also super obsessive with makeup and have heard so many horror stories about girls having to wash it off after having it done at salons in Mexico because some tend to do it really dark, mismatched etc.&amp;nbsp; I wonder if they would do a trial?    I looked into an outside makeup artist (MVP looked really good), however this resort does not allow outside vendors except for photographers, from what the coordinator has told me.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve booked my wedding for the GSP for Nov 19, 2015.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m having my ceremony at the sunset gazebo and doing the Chill out bar for the reception.&amp;nbsp; I was also thinking that the dance floor at $1800 seems crazy overpriced.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m already pushing my budget at $100 per person for the Chill out party, I&#039;m guessing we will have 50-60 guests.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know if you have the Chill out party (the indoor one, not the beach one)&amp;nbsp; and I book the DJ, can I just move tables and create a dance floor you think?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not sure if I will even have the option of dancing on the sand since I&#039;m not doing the beach party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any info or suggestions from previous brides or guests?&amp;nbsp; If we can&#039;t dance at all then I may not book the DJ at all.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My second question, how did you guys decide on menu option for private buffets?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m leaning towards Mexican or BBQ, any suggestions?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879431,"PostDate":1417471859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hair and makeup:\u00a0 My mom is a hairdresser, so doing a combo of having her do it and doing it myself.\u00a0 I've heard its a good idea to bring lots of pics or to get your own stylist at home to do a trial and take tons of pics and bring with you.\u00a0 Pictures are better than words.\u00a0 I can't speak for this specific salon though, sorry.\u00a0 I feel like hair can be slightly changed or salvaged if its not exactly perfect.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Makeup:\u00a0 My photographer recommends airbrush makeup for the humidity, so I'm going to try to get that.\u00a0 I may just buy my own nice Dior airbrush foundation and do it myself as well.\u00a0 I'm also super obsessive with makeup and have heard so many horror stories about girls having to wash it off after having it done at salons in Mexico because some tend to do it really dark, mismatched etc.\u00a0 I wonder if they would do a trial? \u00a0\u00a0 I looked into an outside makeup artist (MVP looked really good), however this resort does not allow outside vendors except for photographers, from what the coordinator has told me.<\/p><br \/><p>I've booked my wedding for the GSP for Nov 19, 2015.\u00a0 I'm having my ceremony at the sunset gazebo and doing the Chill out bar for the reception.\u00a0 I was also thinking that the dance floor at $1800 seems crazy overpriced.\u00a0 I'm already pushing my budget at $100 per person for the Chill out party, I'm guessing we will have 50-60 guests.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone know if you have the Chill out party (the indoor one, not the beach one)\u00a0 and I book the DJ, can I just move tables and create a dance floor you think?\u00a0 I'm not sure if I will even have the option of dancing on the sand since I'm not doing the beach party.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any info or suggestions from previous brides or guests?\u00a0 If we can't dance at all then I may not book the DJ at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My second question, how did you guys decide on menu option for private buffets?\u00a0 I'm leaning towards Mexican or BBQ, any suggestions?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tara_hopper@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.72.80.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405261901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278985.jpg?_r=1405277080","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tehopper","Id":278985,"Name":"tehopper","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.158.206.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8096b2eb17616b7d09599a1b6d9bf2f7","RawContent":"I just asked if we can move tables to make a dance floor. I haven&#039;t heard back yet. \n\nI am also stuck on the buffet. Grilled was suggested as the most popular choice","Attachments":[],"Id":1879846,"PostDate":1417871382,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just asked if we can move tables to make a dance floor. I haven't heard back yet. <br>\nI am also stuck on the buffet. Grilled was suggested as the most popular choice\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rsfortin@telus.net","IpAddress":"75.158.192.149","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401786265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sara1603","Id":278220,"Name":"Sara1603","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"527de0f9f207f98ddf38bdafe1252912","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Sara1603&amp;nbsp; - good question.&amp;nbsp; Let us know what you find out.&amp;nbsp;\n\nI just&amp;nbsp; heard back from Guillermo and I thought I&#039;d share the info.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s not related to what we were all talking about but it might be of interest to someone!&amp;nbsp; lol  We asked him how much the day passes would be for guests staying at a different hotel.&amp;nbsp; He said $95usd per person.&amp;nbsp; access granted from 9am to 2am.&amp;nbsp; Full access to resort all inclusive perks except the a la carte restaurants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880025,"PostDate":1418130290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Sara1603\u00a0 - good question.\u00a0 Let us know what you find out.\u00a0<br>\nI just\u00a0 heard back from Guillermo and I thought I'd share the info.\u00a0 It's not related to what we were all talking about but it might be of interest to someone!\u00a0 lol\u00a0\u00a0We asked him how much the day passes would be for guests staying at a different hotel.\u00a0 He said $95usd per person.\u00a0 access granted from 9am to 2am.\u00a0 Full access to resort all inclusive perks except the a la carte restaurants.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.157.11.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0899d5524386a22e0562bcc500cd12db","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalero\" post=\"1880025\" timestamp=\"1418144690\"]\n@[member=\"Sara1603\"]  - good question.  Let us know what you find out. \nI just  heard back from Guillermo and I thought I&#039;d share the info.  It&#039;s not related to what we were all talking about but it might be of interest to someone!  lol  We asked him how much the day passes would be for guests staying at a different hotel.  He said $95usd per person.  access granted from 9am to 2am.  Full access to resort all inclusive perks except the a la carte restaurants.[\/quote]That&#039;s awesome. My resort charges darn near the same BUT they can only come on one hour before wedding until the time it&#039;s over.   So basically they pay to come on and all they consume is what I&#039;VE paid for in my package. Seems like a rip!! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1880056,"PostDate":1418164516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalero, on 09 December 2014 - 01:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278220\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278220-sara1603\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sara1603<\/span><\/a>  - good question.  Let us know what you find out. <br>\nI just  heard back from Guillermo and I thought I'd share the info.  It's not related to what we were all talking about but it might be of interest to someone!  lol  We asked him how much the day passes would be for guests staying at a different hotel.  He said $95usd per person.  access granted from 9am to 2am.  Full access to resort all inclusive perks except the a la carte restaurants.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's awesome. My resort charges darn near the same BUT they can only come on one hour before wedding until the time it's over.   So basically they pay to come on and all they consume is what I'VE paid for in my package. Seems like a rip!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.158.206.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57e866193dd69c47d78017d3f6b9a8b5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"veryvalero\" post=\"1880025\" timestamp=\"1418144690\"]\n@Sara1603  - good question.  Let us know what you find out. \nI just  heard back from Guillermo and I thought I&#039;d share the info.  It&#039;s not related to what we were all talking about but it might be of interest to someone!  lol  We asked him how much the day passes would be for guests staying at a different hotel.  He said $95usd per person.  access granted from 9am to 2am.  Full access to resort all inclusive perks except the a la carte restaurants.[\/quote]Yes that is a pretty good deal. \nI heard from my WC. Yes we can just push the tables out of the way to dance","Attachments":[],"Id":1880059,"PostDate":1418172221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>veryvalero, on 09 December 2014 - 01:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@Sara1603  - good question.  Let us know what you find out. <br>\nI just  heard back from Guillermo and I thought I'd share the info.  It's not related to what we were all talking about but it might be of interest to someone!  lol  We asked him how much the day passes would be for guests staying at a different hotel.  He said $95usd per person.  access granted from 9am to 2am.  Full access to resort all inclusive perks except the a la carte restaurants.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nYes that is a pretty good deal. <br>\nI heard from my WC. Yes we can just push the tables out of the way to dance\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rsfortin@telus.net","IpAddress":"75.158.192.149","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401786265,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sara1603","Id":278220,"Name":"Sara1603","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4018da745ea0efaff9c1b771b923d22","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@April2015&amp;nbsp; I was just going back to look at this thread and realized that your wedding already passed!&amp;nbsp; How did it go??&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m so excited to hear.&amp;nbsp; I never hear from a lot of Grand sunset brides.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@Sara1603&amp;nbsp; how is your planning coming along?&amp;nbsp; When is your wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just heard that Guillermo left the princess so I&#039;m a little stressed about the planning now.&amp;nbsp; ah&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888568,"PostDate":1425638621,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@April2015\u00a0 I was just going back to look at this thread and realized that your wedding already passed!\u00a0 How did it go??\u00a0 I'm so excited to hear.\u00a0 I never hear from a lot of Grand sunset brides.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@Sara1603\u00a0 how is your planning coming along?\u00a0 When is your wedding?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I just heard that Guillermo left the princess so I'm a little stressed about the planning now.\u00a0 ah<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.57.152.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76890,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1441379186,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"502102b7979a59e7e2149dabd103d761","RawContent":"Hi! I&#039;m vinsidering a wedding at grand sunset princess mid July. I&#039;m still waiting for prices.. Would anyone be able to email me the price list please? I wish it were more easily obtainable!\n\n\nJohannestetka@[member=\"gmail\"].com\n\n\nThank you and happy planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1904173,"PostDate":1441379135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi! I'm vinsidering a wedding at grand sunset princess mid July. I'm still waiting for prices.. Would anyone be able to email me the price list please? I wish it were more easily obtainable!<br><br>\nJohannestetka@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<br><br>\nThank you and happy planning!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"johannestetka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.57.152.66","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441378711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284682.jpg?_r=1442516175","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Johanne514","Id":284682,"Name":"Johanne514","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":56,"TotalPages":6,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":50},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
