ch and I can&#039;t find much online :(&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1667967,"PostDate":1348827754,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Do you guys have any photos of the Himitsu Terrace. \u00a0We are debating between that and the beach and I can't find much online <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tooshorty31@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1348827719,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260801.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tooshorty","Id":260801,"Name":"tooshorty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.71.4.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38437,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23d67c4898347afe2ca3c72b23603518","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ACH2009\"] Hi and thanks for teh great detailed review! I&#039;m not sure if you still check this board, but I&#039;m considering DPC for our Dec wedding and have some questions:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- did your ceremony and reception decor look like the photos on the Dreams website in the online gallery??&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- did you have a DJ for music or did you play from an iPod?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- we might have as many as 60 guests. how much extra was it per guest for dinner, cake, sparkling wine, etc? Since it only includes 20 ppl&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- how was the beach? i know it&#039;s not on Bavaro so I&#039;m wondering if it&#039;s nice white sand, not rocky, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896305,"PostDate":1431607096,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"215071\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/215071-ach2009\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ACH2009<\/span><\/a> Hi and thanks for teh great detailed review! I'm not sure if you still check this board, but I'm considering DPC for our Dec wedding and have some questions:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- did your ceremony and reception decor look like the photos on the Dreams website in the online gallery??\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- did you have a DJ for music or did you play from an iPod?<\/p>\n<p>- we might have as many as 60 guests. how much extra was it per guest for dinner, cake, sparkling wine, etc? Since it only includes 20 ppl<\/p>\n<p>- how was the beach? i know it's not on Bavaro so I'm wondering if it's nice white sand, not rocky, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlookfoe@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.151.178.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428763580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jc14","Id":282709,"Name":"Jc14","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"38437","Title":"Dreams Punta Cana Wedding Review - Andrea & Jason","LastPostDate":1431607096},"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
