"EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"463b3ed8be3c9b47ca3a59e2e84170f6","RawContent":"thanks for the advice. right now i have 30 people and the packages are up to 20 people so i will def look into what package saves us money","Attachments":[],"Id":742773,"PostDate":1246368220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks for the advice. right now i have 30 people and the packages are up to 20 people so i will def look into what package saves us money\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Diane<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rodriguesd327@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221011464,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211657.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DRod0214","Id":211657,"Name":"DRod0214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":38437,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31755d87453c4e38f0b523b1efff65d5","RawContent":"Great review!","Attachments":[],"Id":742790,"PostDate":1246368777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great review!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sperger@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1241624820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217333.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":84,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sperger","Id":217333,"Name":"sperger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38437,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48b984771750a84e13f2353455f187fa","RawContent":"Andrea, thanks for sharing your detailled review. Can&#039;t wait to see your pictures.","Attachments":[],"Id":742848,"PostDate":1246370546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Andrea, thanks for sharing your detailled review. Can't wait to see your pictures.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_madalene@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1235413150,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215182.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beach2009","Id":215182,"Name":"beach2009","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":38437,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49d91868c62f9c63231a0acd6e707327","RawContent":"Thanks for the detailed review! Helping me make some decisions &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n I&#039;d love to see some pics!!","Attachments":[],"Id":743082,"PostDate":1246377676,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the detailed review! Helping me make some decisions <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> I'd love to see some pics!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span><p class='bbc_center'><\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalter&RoySquire\">http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/ourwedding\/AmyWalt