{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":16,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":890,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1904066,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1441249672,"LastPoster":{"Id":281229,"Name":"Brandii","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1904066,"PostDate":1441249672,"PostContent":"Hi everyone. \u00a0I am planning to marry my sweetheart of a whole lot of years (lol) on 2\/14\/16 in Pu...","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441247417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bcc5f38c5a3c81aeff83547712dc5d6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone. &amp;nbsp;I am planning to marry my sweetheart of a whole lot of years (lol) on 2\/14\/16 in Puerto Rico. &amp;nbsp;We were to have married this Saturday, 9\/5\/15 here in Maryland but had to postpone while my FH deals with a medical issue. &amp;nbsp;This past month has been so emotionally difficult for us both and our families. &amp;nbsp;We went from a 30 day countdown to no countdown at all. &amp;nbsp;This was after planning for 1.5 years. :(&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;But it is OK. &amp;nbsp;What matters the most is my FH&#039;s health. I mean we can always choose another day for a wedding but without my man there&#039;s no wedding, right? &amp;nbsp;The good news is that he is responding well to treatment and has an excellent prognosis for a complete recovery. &amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since having to postpone our wedding my FH has talked nonstop about wanting to marry me ASAP after he gets through with his treatment. &amp;nbsp;We got a lot of people suggesting that we go to the JOP but we really wanted to have a ceremony. &amp;nbsp;My DH suggested going to an island with just immediately family and the closest of friends and to do it early in 2016 and then have a big reception. &amp;nbsp;So here I am planning a DW. &amp;nbsp;I am super excited and can&#039;t wait for our BIG DAY. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I look forward to planning with you all and reading all about your wedding day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904066,"PostDate":1441249672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone. \u00a0I am planning to marry my sweetheart of a whole lot of years (lol) on 2\/14\/16 in Puerto Rico. \u00a0We were to have married this Saturday, 9\/5\/15 here in Maryland but had to postpone while my FH deals with a medical issue. \u00a0This past month has been so emotionally difficult for us both and our families. \u00a0We went from a 30 day countdown to no countdown at all. \u00a0This was after planning for 1.5 years. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\u00a0 \u00a0But it is OK. \u00a0What matters the most is my FH's health. I mean we can always choose another day for a wedding but without my man there's no wedding, right? \u00a0The good news is that he is responding well to treatment and has an excellent prognosis for a complete recovery. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since having to postpone our wedding my FH has talked nonstop about wanting to marry me ASAP after he gets through with his treatment. \u00a0We got a lot of people suggesting that we go to the JOP but we really wanted to have a ceremony. \u00a0My DH suggested going to an island with just immediately family and the closest of friends and to do it early in 2016 and then have a big reception. \u00a0So here I am planning a DW. \u00a0I am super excited and can't wait for our BIG DAY. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I look forward to planning with you all and reading all about your wedding day. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441247417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cf3bda4ab172e7907872bfcfe1bb274","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904067,"PostDate":1441251010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55f949c6ac8d9755073539a507073f3e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"1weddingirl\" post=\"1904067\" timestamp=\"1441247410\"]\nI&#039;m so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.[\/quote]\nThank you.  I see you are fairly new yourself.  How&#039;s everything going?","Attachments":[],"Id":1904069,"PostDate":1441251596,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>1weddingirl, on 02 September 2015 - 07:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm so glad your FH is recovering. You have such a beautiful love story. Best wishes for a lifetime of happiness together.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you. \u00a0I see you are fairly new yourself. \u00a0How's everything going?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441247417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e614e54b75cdb1f8485f58a4829c5f43","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ValentineMrs2Be\" post=\"1904069\" timestamp=\"1441247996\"]\nThank you.  I see you are fairly new yourself.  How&#039;s everything going?[\/quote]You&#039;re welcome. Yes, I&#039;m pretty new but enjoying the forum so far. Everything is going great, thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904075,"PostDate":1441252981,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ValentineMrs2Be, on 02 September 2015 - 07:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thank you. \u00a0I see you are fairly new yourself. \u00a0How's everything going?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You're welcome. Yes, I'm pretty new but enjoying the forum so far. Everything is going great, thanks.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a16a9d9104ecb4da535b6748b02ccbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome @[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] (and also&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"1weddingirl\"]!). I&#039;ve never been to PR - but it&#039;s on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904083,"PostDate":1441254482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> (and also\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282948\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282948-1weddingirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">1weddingirl<\/span><\/a>!). I've never been to PR - but it's on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417453045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f590765cf09c895fa3f8775a53ad55f","RawContent":"@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] I am so glad your FI is responding well to treatment. You&#039;ve both been through a lot and I&#039;m so glad that despite all the adversities, you&#039;ve both been optimistic. I&#039;m sure I speak for a lot when I say that we will be more than happy to help you plan. Congrats on planning, you&#039;ll be at your 30 day countdown again before you know it xoxo","Attachments":[],"Id":1904085,"PostDate":1441254805,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> I am so glad your FI is responding well to treatment. You've both been through a lot and I'm so glad that despite all the adversities, you've both been optimistic. I'm sure I speak for a lot when I say that we will be more than happy to help you plan. Congrats on planning, you'll be at your 30 day countdown again before you know it xoxo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410102185,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"990e12e10d56e29af58d0bcffe8ace1f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So glad to hear that your FI is responding to his treatment and that you&#039;re back to planning :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on deciding on a destination wedding.. the fun begins!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904100,"PostDate":1441289100,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So glad to hear that your FI is responding to his treatment and that you're back to planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on deciding on a destination wedding.. the fun begins!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b51926736200705fd2ce775efdc2bc7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] &amp;nbsp;Congrats and welcome! Puerto Rico is a beautiful place for a wedding! Have you decided where? If you need any help, the site owner here is also a travel agent - Wright Travel. They are destination wedding specialists and I&#039;m sure would be happy to help in any way possible. A good TA will free you up to deal with your planning while they work with your guests for bookings and questions. Plus you never know if there might be little extras or perks that you might possibly get from having a group. A TA can tell you that. here is the link to contact them if you like.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m glad to hear your FI is responding to treatment and that the prognosis is good. That&#039;s the most important thing! We&#039;re renewing our vows next month for very similar reasons and I&#039;m still around to celebrate.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find the ladies here more than happy to help with suggestions and ideas. Knowing where you want to be and your date gets you off to a great start.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904143,"PostDate":1441318012,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Congrats and welcome! Puerto Rico is a beautiful place for a wedding! Have you decided where? If you need any help, the site owner here is also a travel agent - Wright Travel. They are destination wedding specialists and I'm sure would be happy to help in any way possible. A good TA will free you up to deal with your planning while they work with your guests for bookings and questions. Plus you never know if there might be little extras or perks that you might possibly get from having a group. A TA can tell you that. here is the link to contact them if you like.\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad to hear your FI is responding to treatment and that the prognosis is good. That's the most important thing! We're renewing our vows next month for very similar reasons and I'm still around to celebrate.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find the ladies here more than happy to help with suggestions and ideas. Knowing where you want to be and your date gets you off to a great start.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to say yes again....October 20, 2015\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2dccb89798fad2454d4b6061abd2953","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1904083\" timestamp=\"1441250882\"]\nWelcome @[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] (and also @[member=\"1weddingirl\"]!). I&#039;ve never been to PR - but it&#039;s on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? :)[\/quote]\nI am very excited and yes good things come to those who wait.  \n[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1904085\" timestamp=\"1441251205\"]\n@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] I am so glad your FI is responding well to treatment. You&#039;ve both been through a lot and I&#039;m so glad that despite all the adversities, you&#039;ve both been optimistic. I&#039;m sure I speak for a lot when I say that we will be more than happy to help you plan. Congrats on planning, you&#039;ll be at your 30 day countdown again before you know it xoxo[\/quote]\nWe&#039;ve have optimism on steroids!  We won&#039;t be beat.  I am eager for the big day and I know it will come soon.\n[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1904100\" timestamp=\"1441285500\"]\nSo glad to hear that your FI is responding to his treatment and that you&#039;re back to planning :)\nCongrats on deciding on a destination wedding.. the fun begins!! :)[\/quote]\nYes the fun begins.  I hear planning a DW can be challenging but oh so rewarding.  \n[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1904143\" timestamp=\"1441314412\"]\n@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"]  Congrats and welcome! Puerto Rico is a beautiful place for a wedding! Have you decided where? If you need any help, the site owner here is also a travel agent - Wright Travel. They are destination wedding specialists and I&#039;m sure would be happy to help in any way possible. A good TA will free you up to deal with your planning while they work with your guests for bookings and questions. Plus you never know if there might be little extras or perks that you might possibly get from having a group. A TA can tell you that. here is the link to contact them if you like. [url=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\"]http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/[\/url]\n\nI&#039;m glad to hear your FI is responding to treatment and that the prognosis is good. That&#039;s the most important thing! We&#039;re renewing our vows next month for very similar reasons and I&#039;m still around to celebrate.\n\nYou&#039;ll find the ladies here more than happy to help with suggestions and ideas. Knowing where you want to be and your date gets you off to a great start. \n\nGood luck and happy planning![\/quote]\nThank you.  I will check out the link you gave me.  I will definitely be interested in getting help with all of the travel items for this wedding.  That is awesome that you will be renewing your vows.  I am sure it will be a great event for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904149,"PostDate":1441337150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 02 September 2015 - 08:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Welcome @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> (and also\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282948\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282948-1weddingirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">1weddingirl<\/span><\/a>!). I've never been to PR - but it's on the list for a visit one day. Glad to hear your FH is doing well and you must be so excited about your wedding next year. Good things come to those who wait, right? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am very excited and yes good things come to those who wait. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 02 September 2015 - 08:33 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> I am so glad your FI is responding well to treatment. You've both been through a lot and I'm so glad that despite all the adversities, you've both been optimistic. I'm sure I speak for a lot when I say that we will be more than happy to help you plan. Congrats on planning, you'll be at your 30 day countdown again before you know it xoxo<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've have optimism on steroids! \u00a0We won't be beat. \u00a0I am eager for the big day and I know it will come soon.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 03 September 2015 - 06:05 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So glad to hear that your FI is responding to his treatment and that you're back to planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Congrats on deciding on a destination wedding.. the fun begins!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes the fun begins. \u00a0I hear planning a DW can be challenging but oh so rewarding. \u00a0<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 03 September 2015 - 02:06 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Congrats and welcome! Puerto Rico is a beautiful place for a wedding! Have you decided where? If you need any help, the site owner here is also a travel agent - Wright Travel. They are destination wedding specialists and I'm sure would be happy to help in any way possible. A good TA will free you up to deal with your planning while they work with your guests for bookings and questions. Plus you never know if there might be little extras or perks that you might possibly get from having a group. A TA can tell you that. here is the link to contact them if you like.\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad to hear your FI is responding to treatment and that the prognosis is good. That's the most important thing! We're renewing our vows next month for very similar reasons and I'm still around to celebrate.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find the ladies here more than happy to help with suggestions and ideas. Knowing where you want to be and your date gets you off to a great start.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you. \u00a0I will check out the link you gave me. \u00a0I will definitely be interested in getting help with all of the travel items for this wedding. \u00a0That is awesome that you will be renewing your vows. \u00a0I am sure it will be a great event for you.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441247417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.113.222.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6749d7dbf44c8d09a2d99a994c078917","RawContent":"Congratulations I am glad your FH is doing better. And Puerto Rico is really nice. Been there a couple of times. The beaches there are really nice you are going to have a really nice wedding there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904157,"PostDate":1441372860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations I am glad your FH is doing better. And Puerto Rico is really nice. Been there a couple of times. The beaches there are really nice you are going to have a really nice wedding there.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lori.yepez@aa.com","IpAddress":"173.74.136.107","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440298010,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lorishultz2016","Id":284536,"Name":"lorishultz2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79563","Title":"Dw Wedding After Postponing But I Am Ok.  Introducing Me.","LastPostDate":1442847729},"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
