{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc02a0fe497f41c06e1c2236b7336288","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, ValentineMrs2Be and 1weddingirl, and Congrats on your upcoming destination weddings!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So glad to hear you&#039;ve overcome the challenges you&#039;ve faced and are looking forward to celebrating your love for a lifetime together - Cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;With all the resources you&#039;ll find here, it&#039;s sure to be a big help with your planning decisions - wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans.....enjoy your journey!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...for some added inspiration, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter to ramp up your creativity ....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11053513_10153584442674487_5212815072185056568_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053513_10153584442674487_5212815072185\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011138904_o.jpg\" alt=\"11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044648467_o.jpg\" alt=\"11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904166,"PostDate":1441387439,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, ValentineMrs2Be and 1weddingirl, and Congrats on your upcoming destination weddings!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So glad to hear you've overcome the challenges you've faced and are looking forward to celebrating your love for a lifetime together - Cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>With all the resources you'll find here, it's sure to be a big help with your planning decisions - wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans.....enjoy your journey!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...for some added inspiration, here are a few magical wedding moments that matter to ramp up your creativity ....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/11053513_10153584442674487_5212815072185056568_o.jpg\" alt=\"11053513_10153584442674487_5212815072185\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011138904_o.jpg\" alt=\"11539061_10153447165824487_8009383179011\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044648467_o.jpg\" alt=\"11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a12d3161d5ab6d7bb8de8209942086f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lorishultz2016\" post=\"1904157\" timestamp=\"1441369260\"]\nCongratulations I am glad your FH is doing better. And Puerto Rico is really nice. Been there a couple of times. The beaches there are really nice you are going to have a really nice wedding there.[\/quote]\nThank you.  My FH went there for work earlier this year and fell in love with PR.  When the idea of a DW came up PR was his immediate choice.  :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1904179,"PostDate":1441416331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lorishultz2016, on 04 September 2015 - 05:21 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congratulations I am glad your FH is doing better. And Puerto Rico is really nice. Been there a couple of times. The beaches there are really nice you are going to have a really nice wedding there.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you. \u00a0My FH went there for work earlier this year and fell in love with PR. \u00a0When the idea of a DW came up PR was his immediate choice. \u00a0:-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441247417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a96d841bb15aaf3570c80f73e45e4bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So glad to hear your fianc\u00e9 is recovering well! It sounds like a DW is the way to go :) Something beautiful with just your closest family and friends surrounding you is ALWAYS a wonderful idea -- as a wedding photographer, I absolutely LOVE small intimate affairs because they are much more personal and they are fueled with so much emotion and love for the couple. My husband and I actually got married on the 10th anniversary of our first date, so I know what it means to have to wait LOL. But remember, good things come to those who wait -- I think your celebration is going to be amazing. Wishing you both the very best as your journey toward your Big Day&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904188,"PostDate":1441441160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So glad to hear your fianc\u00e9 is recovering well! It sounds like a DW is the way to go <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Something beautiful with just your closest family and friends surrounding you is ALWAYS a wonderful idea -- as a wedding photographer, I absolutely LOVE small intimate affairs because they are much more personal and they are fueled with so much emotion and love for the couple. My husband and I actually got married on the 10th anniversary of our first date, so I know what it means to have to wait LOL. But remember, good things come to those who wait -- I think your celebration is going to be amazing. Wishing you both the very best as your journey toward your Big Day\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285957945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.118.235.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"045e4e40dae69e831f1be68caf4e4fef","RawContent":"@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] welcome! Wow, I&#039;m real glad that your FH is doing much better. I&#039;m so sorry for what him and you had to go through. I know how it is. I, too, have a medical problem. It&#039;s chronic, and it&#039;s hard to deal with everyday and I&#039;m on treatment, too. I think that you should definitely do a DW, because, in my opinion, you should do something adventurous rather than a local, traditional wedding. You beat the odds, You deserve it! \n\n\nI&#039;m somewhat in the same boat as you for having to postpone my own wedding, but for financial reasons (so not as extraordinary as your situation) which I had hoped would be 3\/14\/17 but now i might not know when I will be able to settle on a date. All I know is that it will most likely be sometime in 2017. Really glad to hear that you are able to possibly move on with your plans. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1904507,"PostDate":1441950800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> welcome! Wow, I'm real glad that your FH is doing much better. I'm so sorry for what him and you had to go through. I know how it is. I, too, have a medical problem. It's chronic, and it's hard to deal with everyday and I'm on treatment, too. I think that you should definitely do a DW, because, in my opinion, you should do something adventurous rather than a local, traditional wedding. You beat the odds, You deserve it! <br><br>\nI'm somewhat in the same boat as you for having to postpone my own wedding, but for financial reasons (so not as extraordinary as your situation) which I had hoped would be 3\/14\/17 but now i might not know when I will be able to settle on a date. All I know is that it will most likely be sometime in 2017. Really glad to hear that you are able to possibly move on with your plans. Good luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrae2958@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.59.137.216","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440025420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284488.jpg?_r=1440023025","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":170,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackyrae","Id":284488,"Name":"jackyrae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b7982bb7060949e1c7f489f0a964471","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jackyrae\" post=\"1904507\" timestamp=\"1441947200\"]\n@[member=\"ValentineMrs2Be\"] welcome! Wow, I&#039;m real glad that your FH is doing much better. I&#039;m so sorry for what him and you had to go through. I know how it is. I, too, have a medical problem. It&#039;s chronic, and it&#039;s hard to deal with everyday and I&#039;m on treatment, too. I think that you should definitely do a DW, because, in my opinion, you should do something adventurous rather than a local, traditional wedding. You beat the odds, You deserve it!\n\nI&#039;m somewhat in the same boat as you for having to postpone my own wedding, but for financial reasons (so not as extraordinary as your situation) which I had hoped would be 3\/14\/17 but now i might not know when I will be able to settle on a date. All I know is that it will most likely be sometime in 2017. Really glad to hear that you are able to possibly move on with your plans. Good luck![\/quote]\n[b]@[member=\"jackyrae\"][\/b] - One of my BMs said something similar to what you said.  She said our love is not traditional so it makes sense for us to have a DW, something wonderful, different, and special.  I hope your treatment goes well and that you are able to set a hard date sooner rather than later. \n[quote name=\"MarieSamSanchezPhoto\" post=\"1904188\" timestamp=\"1441437560\"]\nSo glad to hear your fianc\u00e9 is recovering well! It sounds like a DW is the way to go :) Something beautiful with just your closest family and friends surrounding you is ALWAYS a wonderful idea -- as a wedding photographer, I absolutely LOVE small intimate affairs because they are much more personal and they are fueled with so much emotion and love for the couple. My husband and I actually got married on the 10th anniversary of our first date, so I know what it means to have to wait LOL. But remember, good things come to those who wait -- I think your celebration is going to be amazing. Wishing you both the very best as your journey toward your Big Day  :)[\/quote]\n@[member=\"MarieSamSanchezPhoto\"] - Thank you.  Good things do come to those who wait.","Attachments":[],"Id":1904554,"PostDate":1442008402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jackyrae, on 10 September 2015 - 09:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284656\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284656-valentinemrs2be\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ValentineMrs2Be<\/span><\/a> welcome! Wow, I'm real glad that your FH is doing much better. I'm so sorry for what him and you had to go through. I know how it is. I, too, have a medical problem. It's chronic, and it's hard to deal with everyday and I'm on treatment, too. I think that you should definitely do a DW, because, in my opinion, you should do something adventurous rather than a local, traditional wedding. You beat the odds, You deserve it!<br><br>\nI'm somewhat in the same boat as you for having to postpone my own wedding, but for financial reasons (so not as extraordinary as your situation) which I had hoped would be 3\/14\/17 but now i might not know when I will be able to settle on a date. All I know is that it will most likely be sometime in 2017. Really glad to hear that you are able to possibly move on with your plans. Good luck!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284488\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284488-jackyrae\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jackyrae<\/span><\/a><\/strong> - One of my BMs said something similar to what you said. \u00a0She said our love is not traditional so it makes sense for us to have a DW, something wonderful, different, and special. \u00a0I hope your treatment goes well and that you are able to set a hard date sooner rather than later.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MarieSamSanchezPhoto, on 05 September 2015 - 12:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So glad to hear your fianc\u00e9 is recovering well! It sounds like a DW is the way to go <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Something beautiful with just your closest family and friends surrounding you is ALWAYS a wonderful idea -- as a wedding photographer, I absolutely LOVE small intimate affairs because they are much more personal and they are fueled with so much emotion and love for the couple. My husband and I actually got married on the 10th anniversary of our first date, so I know what it means to have to wait LOL. But remember, good things come to those who wait -- I think your celebration is going to be amazing. Wishing you both the very best as your journey toward your Big Day\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232833\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232833-mariesamsanchezphoto\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MarieSamSanchezPhoto<\/span><\/a> - Thank you. \u00a0Good things do come to those who wait. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:#cc0099;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">Love is the greatest super power. \u00a0It can make you weak and strong at the same time.<\/span><\/span><\/em>","Email":"islandheart67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.56.156.67","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441247417,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284656.jpg?_r=1441244141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ValentineMrs2Be","Id":284656,"Name":"ValentineMrs2Be","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79563,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06e1933f112b2f528ff8e300b645a372","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats! I&#039;ve never been to PR but I have friends who have and they LOVED it. It&#039;s a shame you had to postpone your wedding but I&#039;m happy that he is responding well to the treatments.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck in your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905130,"PostDate":1442847729,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats! I've never been to PR but I have friends who have and they LOVED it. It's a shame you had to postpone your wedding but I'm happy that he is responding well to the treatments.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck in your planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"empty_xo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416701137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brandii","Id":281229,"Name":"Brandii","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":16,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
